{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本一隻小北極熊在網上爆紅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">秋田縣男鹿水族館，約八個月大的北極熊「桃太」，原本已因為牠喜歡玩俗稱「雪糕筒」的交通路錐，成為該園人氣明星。近日牠被拍到把頭塞進「雪糕筒」，橫衝直撞，甚到撞向牠媽媽「桃子」，片段在網上爆紅。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300_005.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026abHLhwK6fL1786460295.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300_005.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026DBOUtnHLoV1786452888.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026OTaA9roA5j1786452901.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">有人形容「桃太」化身可愛的「獨角獸」，「桃子」後來把「雪糕筒」拔走，「桃太」則咬著「雪糕筒」碎片下水，似乎要向遊客展示牠的「玩具」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T15:03:43.136312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}